---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import ProductWordmark from '../components/ProductWordmark.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

import { products } from '../data/products.mjs';
import { repositories } from '../data/repositories.mjs';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const DOCS = '/docs';

// Canonical first calculation — kept in lockstep with docs/quickstart.md.
const code = `import vibeqc as vq
import numpy as np

mol = vq.Molecule([
    vq.Atom(8, [ 0.0,  0.00,  0.00]),
    vq.Atom(1, [ 0.0,  1.43, -0.98]),
    vq.Atom(1, [ 0.0, -1.43, -0.98]),
])
basis = vq.BasisSet(mol, "6-31g*")
result = vq.run_rhf(mol, basis)

eps = np.asarray(result.mo_energies)
homo = mol.n_electrons() // 2 - 1
print(f"E(SCF)  = {result.energy:.6f} Ha")
print(f"ε(HOMO) = {eps[homo]*27.211386:.2f} eV")
print(f"gap     = {(eps[homo+1] - eps[homo])*27.211386:.2f} eV")`;
---

<Base
  title="Get started — vibe-qc"
  description="Choose vibe-qc for calculations, vibe-view for visualization, or vibe-queue for scheduling, then follow the independent installation guide."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="wrap gs">
    <section class="gs-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">get started</span>
      <h1>Choose where your work begins.</h1>
      <p>
        Calculate, visualize, or schedule. Install each product independently;
        you can open results or queue other programs without installing the engine.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="next" aria-label="Choose a product">
      <div class="next-grid">
        {products.map(product => <a class="ncard" href={`${base}products/${product.id}/`}>
          <h3><ProductWordmark product={product.id} label={product.name} /><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p>{product.summary}</p>
        </a>)}
      </div>
    </section>
    <h2 class="next">First calculation with vibe-qc</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h2><span class="n">1</span> Install</h2>
        <p class="note">Clone the public source, then enter it and install:</p>
        <pre class="code"><code>git clone https://github.com/vibe-qc/vibe-qc.git</code></pre>
        <pre class="code"><code>cd vibe-qc
./scripts/install.sh --dev</code></pre>
        <p class="note">
          <code>install.sh</code> builds the native core, creates a virtualenv and
          installs vibe-qc. It accepts <code>--dev</code> (track main) and
          <code>--branch NAME</code>; see the
          <a href={`${DOCS}/installation.html`}>installation guide</a> for the full
          surface and the manual native-deps recipe.
        </p>
        <p class="note">GitHub HTTPS clones are anonymous. The installer above selects
          main from that origin; choose a published tag to pin a version.
          <a href={`${DOCS}/installation.html#repositories-and-downloads`}>Source details</a>.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2><span class="n">2</span> Run RHF on water</h2>
        <pre class="code"><code>{code}</code></pre>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2><span class="n">3</span> Read the result</h2>
        <p class="note">
          You get the SCF energy in hartree and the HOMO energy plus HOMO–LUMO gap in
          eV. Swap <code>run_rhf</code> for <code>run_rks</code>, <code>run_mp2</code>,
          or a periodic driver to go further — same front-end, same objects.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <section class="next" aria-labelledby="repositories-heading">
      <h2 id="repositories-heading">Four repositories, shared files.</h2>
      <p>Install the engine for calculations, then add the companions you need.
        Each repository has its own checkout and release tags. GitLab requires
        authorized access; the GitHub mirrors provide public source snapshots.</p>
      <div class="next-grid">
        {repositories.map(repository => <article class="ncard">
          <h3>{repository.name}</h3>
          <p>{repository.role}</p>
          <p class="repository-links">
            <a href={repository.github}>GitHub source</a> ·
            <a href={`${repository.github}/tags`}>Source tags</a>
          </p>
        </article>)}
      </div>
      <p>vibe-qc implements QVF independently and is validated against the published
        format; the QVF reference toolkit is not a runtime dependency.</p>
      <p>Generate a QVF archive with the core, open that file with the separate viewer,
        and use the queue when scheduling is needed. Start with
        <a href={`${DOCS}/tutorial/qvf_job_containers.html`}>the QVF container example</a>,
        <a href={`${base}products/vibe-view/#install`}>viewer setup</a>, or
        <a href={`${base}products/vibe-queue/#install`}>queue setup</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="next">
      <h2>Where to next</h2>
      <div class="next-grid">
        <a class="ncard" href={`${DOCS}/quickstart.html`}>
          <h3>Quickstart <span class="arrow">→</span></h3>
          <p>The full first-run walkthrough, line by line.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="ncard" href={`${DOCS}/tutorial/index.html`}>
          <h3>Tutorials <span class="arrow">→</span></h3>
          <p>Step-by-step tutorials, molecular through periodic.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="ncard" href={`${DOCS}/user_guide/index.html`}>
          <h3>User guide <span class="arrow">→</span></h3>
          <p>Methods, basis sets, functionals, ECPs, periodic systems.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="ncard" href={`${DOCS}/example_outputs.html`}>
          <h3>Example outputs <span class="arrow">→</span></h3>
          <p>Annotated output from real vibe-qc runs.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .gs { padding: 64px 28px 100px; }
  .gs-head { max-width: 60ch; }
  .gs-head h1 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .gs-head p { color: var(--slate); font-size: 19px; margin: 18px 0 0; }

  .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: none; margin: 54px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; }
  .steps > li { margin: 0; }
  .steps h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .steps h2 .n {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--phase-pos); color: var(--on-accent);
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .steps .note { color: var(--slate); font-size: 15.5px; margin: 14px 0 0; max-width: 62ch; }
  .steps .note code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.88em; color: var(--phase-neg); background: var(--surface-2); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 5px; }

  .code {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px 24px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
    tab-size: 4;
  }
  .code code { font-family: inherit; white-space: pre; }

  .next { margin-top: 72px; }
  #repositories-heading { scroll-margin-top: 96px; }
  .next > p a { color: var(--phase-pos); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .next h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 26px; }
  .next-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .next-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .ncard {
    display: block;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px 24px;
    transition: transform .16s, border-color .16s, box-shadow .16s;
  }
  .ncard:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--phase-pos) 45%, var(--line)); box-shadow: 0 16px 36px -24px var(--phase-pos); }
  .ncard h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--phase-pos); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .ncard:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }
  .ncard .arrow { transition: transform .15s; }
  .ncard .repository-links { margin-top: 14px; }
  .repository-links a { color: var(--phase-pos); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .ncard p { color: var(--slate); font-size: 14.5px; margin: 0; }
</style>
